WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:04.272
( music)

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.130
- Hi everyone, and I'm glad
to be in the company of

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.030
other language teachers, but the points

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.090
that I'm going to talk
about and mention today

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.940
don't really have anything
to do with language.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.750
So, hopefully they'll
be useful to everyone.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.660
So, like many of you, when we
first started using Canvas,

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.650
I had this huge fear of, like, oh my god,

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.310
this is going to be a huge waste of time,

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:34.420
I'm going to have to spend
so much time learning

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:37.530
how to do this, I'm going to
have to spend so much time

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:40.050
putting all my teaching resources on it,

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.550
this is a whole new learning process.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.690
So what I'm going to talk
about today, is, like,

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:49.910
things that I did in order to
save time, and cut on time,

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:52.240
and things that I know
students appreciate it,

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.310
because not only did it save me time,

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:56.340
but it saved them time as well.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.190
So I'm going to start from the beginning,

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.020
and I'm sure you're
familiar with this picture.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.550
This is what we see when we first want to

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:03.940
log in and check Canvas.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.580
And you can see that these
are the tabs for the classes,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.400
and the way to tell one
class from the other

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.770
is the color, I don't know about you,

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:16.610
but as far as I'm concerned,
a number of times I clicked

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:19.750
on the wrong box and I found
myself in the wrong class.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.260
And I'm like, no, this is
not at all what I want to do.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.900
And I had to go back a
couple of steps to enter.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:26.840
An easy way to solve this problem

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:31.330
is if you personalize your class,

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.610
and put a picture as to
what each class looks like,

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.740
so these are two of the
classes that I'm teaching

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.580
this semester, each one has a picture.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:42.760
It's a lot easier for me to
click on the right picture

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.260
when I want to go to the right class.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.360
And also, as far as the
students is concerned,

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:49.760
'cause like you, they have
like four or five tabs

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.460
that are only different in color,

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.760
but now, when there's a
picture to your class,

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:57.333
they can easily identify it
and access it quite easily.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:01.300
Another thing that I found useful

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.140
and saved me a lot of time,
is using the calendar.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.355
We've heard already a
couple of our presenters

00:02:07.355 --> 00:02:10.640
mentioning different
techniques of using Canvas.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.730
Calendar is one of them, it
certainly is not the only one.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.970
This is where calendar is,
if you haven't used it.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.810
And when you click on it,
you can go to the calendar,

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:24.190
and what you can do is for every day,

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.520
or for every week, or
multiple times a day,

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.130
you can set up different events.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.746
And what I do is I start early,

00:02:32.746 --> 00:02:34.840
before the beginning of the semester.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:39.180
I go to the calendar and I
put in every single test,

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.240
or quiz, or a writing assignment,

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:46.040
or grading activity, or even
activities that are not graded

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.830
that might be of
importance to the student.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.510
And when you go to the calendar,
when you click on each day,

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.520
this is the tab that you're going to get.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:59.350
What allows you to put
in either an activity,

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:01.970
or an assignment, and the
details, and the link,

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.030
and the time, et cetera et cetera.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:07.770
The other thing that you can
do from the same calendar

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:11.730
is you can have it assigned
to two different classes,

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:14.000
or three different
classes, for that matter.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.080
As a language teacher, I
teach multiple sections,

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.950
so this is useful, I don't have
to do the same thing again.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.450
Rather, all I have to
do is change the class

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.840
and add it to the calendar of that class.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.473
The other amazing thing, once I'm done,

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:31.350
on the main page of what the students see,

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.630
they can see, as you can see right here,

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.730
all the times, all the activities

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.420
that I've set up in the
calendar, they're all there

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:42.330
nicely arranged
chronologically, so they know

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.440
when they have a test and
when they have a quiz.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:47.070
They don't need to ask me,
I don't need to answer.

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.373
Everybody's saving time.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.580
Another nice thing about calendar is that

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.463
you can actually synchronize it,

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:59.330
so if you click on this tab over here,

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.430
you'll find out that there's an option

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:05.640
that you can add all these
dates to your Google calendar.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.642
Whatever your personal Google calendar is,

00:04:07.642 --> 00:04:11.920
you can add, so this
is what you would get.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:16.920
And if you take the link and
add it to your Google calendar,

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:20.540
all these dates will be added
to your Google calendar.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.300
It's especially helpful for the students,

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.920
because they have other
events and other classes

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.730
and other stuff that they have to do.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:29.750
This way they can see everything
on their Google calendar

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:32.463
without having to ask me,
and I don't have to answer.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.750
The other thing that I do that saves me

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.360
and the students time,
is I use assignment,

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:44.360
and when I set up assignments,
I give each one of them value

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:48.310
depending on category,
and when I do that, again,

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:51.260
through the magic of Canvas, they can see

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:55.620
on their first page, on the
front page of the class,

00:04:55.620 --> 00:05:00.590
they can see exactly
what are the graded items

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:01.580
that they have to go through,

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.430
and how much each of them is worth.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.410
Yes, we have a syllabus, and the syllabus

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.717
we put all this thing together,
but it's nice for them

00:05:07.717 --> 00:05:10.180
through one click, as
soon as they sign in,

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:13.333
they can see all this information
without having to ask me.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:19.020
The other advice that I have for everyone,

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.860
I have been teaching for a while,

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.470
and I have developed a
number of teaching resources.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.930
And I found out using Canvas,
that there's always a way

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.100
to imbed materials that
you have had from the past,

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.103
you don't need to do it
again, all you have to do

00:05:34.103 --> 00:05:37.810
is ask someone, or get
the advice of someone.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.400
And there's always a way to
imbed your previous materials.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.610
I have successfully been
able to imbed videos,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.240
other teaching materials
that I've used in the past

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:51.480
from other technological resources.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.580
And again, I teach
elementary, at least I'm

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.490
teaching elementary this year, so a lot

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:59.100
of my teaching material came
from different resources.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:02.670
And I was successful in
imbeding all of them.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.820
And this enables me to use it on the site

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.810
for the students as
assignment, or as homework,

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:13.180
but even in the class
it has been quite useful

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.476
and quite helpful, and
I didn't have to change

00:06:15.476 --> 00:06:18.350
a whole lot of my teaching materials.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.860
So these were just some tips from me

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.130
that I hope will save
you some time, and also

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:26.170
save your students some time,
which they will appreciate.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.182
Thank you very much.

00:06:27.182 --> 00:06:29.432
(applause)

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.523
Any questions?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:35.643
Yes.

00:06:40.383 --> 00:06:42.350
- [Person In Audience] When
you set up the calendar,

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.550
do you have to do it every year,

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.770
or you can navigate it
like the assignments?

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:49.100
- No, I'm afraid you have
to do it every semester,

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.540
because the way I do it
is depending on the date.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.270
That's why you can't
move it from one semester

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:59.250
to the other, yes, I
set it up by the dates

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:03.223
for the quizzes and the tests,
and the written assignments.

00:07:08.637 --> 00:07:10.828
- [Person In Audience]
From a student perspective,

00:07:10.828 --> 00:07:11.661
oh, sorry.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.690
If I set up the calendar for my course,

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:18.688
from the student perspective, if they have

00:07:18.688 --> 00:07:21.520
a number of different courses,

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.100
does their calendar then show things

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.530
from all the different
courses with different colors?

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.430
- Yes, that's exactly-
- So that when they complain

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:32.810
that they can't figure out
how to sync their lives up,

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.650
they have a way of doing
that if we've helped them

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.140
by putting it on the calendar?

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:36.973
- Yes, exactly.

00:07:36.973 --> 00:07:40.040
And yes, so, whatever items there are

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.490
on the Canvas calendar,
they will be different

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.230
with different colors.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.910
And when you hover the mouse over it,

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:47.490
it will tell you the name of the class.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.851
Like, let's say they're not sure

00:07:48.851 --> 00:07:51.270
which class is the pink color.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.770
If you just hover the mouse over it,

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:55.025
it will tell you which class that is.

00:07:55.025 --> 00:07:55.858
- [Person In Audience] Thank you.

00:07:55.858 --> 00:07:57.037
- Certainly, you're welcome.

00:07:57.037 --> 00:07:58.910
- [Person In Audience] Which
Canvas tools do you use

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.790
to imbed the examples that you gave here?

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.550
For example, do you use assignments,

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.512
do you use the quizzes?

00:08:06.512 --> 00:08:11.512
- I've been able to imbed
stuff in mostly assignments,

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:15.190
but also in the pages,
and even on the front page

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.860
I've been able to imbed stuff.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:17.693
Absolutely.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.153
You're welcome.

00:08:25.376 --> 00:08:27.260
- [Person In Audience] When
you're using the calendar,

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.650
is it possible for students to, like,

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.500
click on the event and have
it go directly to Canvas

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.040
for that assignment?
- Yes, yes, absolutely.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.150
If it is something that will take,

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:39.510
that is linked to an
assignment, or a quiz,

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:41.470
yes, it will take them there
right away, absolutely.

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:42.303
Yep.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.932
- And then you can import, in other words,

00:08:47.932 --> 00:08:51.440
if you set up, we just did a
debate, for example, today,

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.730
because I use it not only
for my written quizzes.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.860
If the quiz is set up electronically,

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.480
you can import from year to year,

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.170
and the dates will adjust for you.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.090
So it automatically adjusts beautiful.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.490
You don't have to do it by hand.

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.994
But presume you don't
want to put all your tests

00:09:06.994 --> 00:09:10.600
on Canvas, so then it depends what you do.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:14.060
If you have, say, oral
presentations assignment,

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:17.010
then I believe, again, as
long as the date is given.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:21.990
Like today, we did
orals, and there is a tab

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.140
that requires submissions.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:26.910
So that means, when I import
resources for next year,

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.470
the date will adjust for me.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.672
In other words, it will
still be that assignment

00:09:30.672 --> 00:09:33.600
on Tuesday, or whatever the new date.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:35.780
It will automatically adjust, so

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.309
yes, you will, depends on what type,

00:09:38.309 --> 00:09:40.740
like fellow presentations obviously,

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.780
that you have to import by hand,

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:45.100
but other events it will import.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.023
So you don't have to do all of it by hand.

00:09:54.307 --> 00:09:56.557
(applause)

00:09:58.887 --> 00:10:00.944
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

00:10:00.944 --> 00:10:03.527
(music)

